f`, etc.) as a possible shortcut — their page content lives in `FlateDecode` streams, so no visible text appears without decompression. `grep` for `Tj`/`BT`/`FlateDecode` returned nothing because it skips binary files. Those files are also unrelated to your zip, so I can't substitute them.\\n\\n## To unblock\\n\\nRe-run this with bash permitted (or approve the permission prompt when it appears). Ready-to-use sequence:\\n\\n```bash\\nmkdir -p /tmp/bfcd && cd /tmp/bfcd\\nunzip -o \\\"D:/GoatCode-ts/gaia/data/bfcd99e1-0690-4b53-a85c-0174a8629083.zip\\\"\\nls -la\\n\\n# PDF -> text (every page, layout preserved)\\npdftotext -layout \\\"Job Listing.pdf\\\" job.txt && cat job.txt\\n\\n# if pdftotext is missing:\\npip install pypdf openpyxl\\npython -c \\\"\\nimport pypdf\\nr = pypdf.PdfReader('Job Listing.pdf')\\nprint(f'--- {len(r.pages)} pages ---')\\nfor i, p in enumerate(r.pages): print(f'=== PAGE {i+1} ===\\\\n' + p.extract_text())\\n\\\"\\n\\n# applicant descriptions (the xlsx, not a PDF)\\npython -c \\\"\\nimport openpyxl\\nwb = openpyxl.load_workbook('Applicants.xlsx', data_only=True)\\nfor ws in wb:\\n    print(f'=== SHEET: {ws.title} ===')\\n    for row in ws.iter_rows(values_only=True):\\n        if any(c is not None for c in row): print(' | '.join('' if c is None else str(c) for c in row))\\n\\\"\\n```\\n\\nWant me to keep trying other angles (e.g. if there's a non-bash path to a Python/Node runtime in this environment), or will you re-run with bash enabled?\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_9a2bb16992644ffda13177fb\",\"name\":\"task\"}\n   17\t{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"\",\"toolCalls\":[{\"id\":\"call_b8d0c64797d646449ba38755\",\"name\":\"bash\",\"arguments\":{\"command\":\"python --version\"}}]}\n   18\t{\"role\":\"tool\",\"content\":\"permission required but no prompt available for bash\",\"toolCallId\":\"call_b8d0c64797d646449ba38755\",\"name\":\"bash\"}\n   19\t{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"\",\"toolCalls\":[{\"id\":\"call_725b99ed8c314b1a9d4d0f